WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.767
Hands busy?

2
00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.167
Just talk to me.

3
00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:04.667
Tap me any time

4
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:05.033
for help

5
00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.400
with the screen you’re on.

6
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.033
Or hold the mic,

7
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.200
and say QR.

8
00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:13.300
Say select Xtreme 125R,

9
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.233
and it’s picked

10
00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:15.167
for you.

11
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.167
Hold the mic and try it now.
